.TH SOCMOND-CORE-HANDLER 1 "October 2026" "OTA-Pulse" "OTA-Pulse Manual"
.SH NAME
socmond-core-handler \- core dump handler of the OTA-Pulse monitoring daemon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B socmond-core-handler
.I pid uid gid signal time limit host executable
.SH DESCRIPTION
Called by the kernel through \fBkernel.core_pattern\fR (see \fI/usr/lib/sysctl.d/90-socmond-coredump.conf\fR),
not by users. It stores the core dump in \fI/var/lib/socmond/coredumps\fR, limited in size, so that
\fBsocmond\fR(1) can upload it.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR socmond (1),
.BR core (5)
